sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant R as tools_chat (the loop)
    participant C as MCP client
    participant S as MCP server (subprocess)
    participant M as Model
    U->>R: "What are Acme's open deals?"
    R->>C: start session
    C->>S: spawn python -m app.mcp.server
    C->>S: initialize, then tools/list
    S-->>C: the four tools and their schemas
    C-->>R: tool list (names, descriptions, arguments)
    R->>M: system prompt that lists the tools + the question
    M-->>R: text with a fenced tool_call block
    R->>R: regex finds the block, json.loads it
    R->>C: call get_open_deals(company_name="Acme")
    C->>S: tools/call
    S-->>C: result as a JSON text block
    R->>M: conversation + "Tool result ..." in untrusted_context tags
    M-->>R: plain-text final answer
    R-->>U: answer + toolsUsed
    C->>S: close, and the subprocess exits
